description:
The Naval War College (NWC) requires contractor support services to provide professional executive support services to one (1) Senior Leader to enhance leadership effectiveness, strategic thinking, organizational influence, communication, decision-making, and workforce engagement. The coaching engagement shall support the executive&rsquo;s continued development in leading complex organizations, advancing strategic priorities, and strengthening leadership capabilities that contribute to organizational performance and mission success. &nbsp; 

 Period of Performance:  7 December 2026 to 6 December 2027 

 Questions:  Quoter may submit questions regarding clarification of solicitation requirements via email to Abbey Taylor at mary.a.taylor263.civ@us.navy.mil. It is requested that all questions be received no later than 12:00PM EST on 10 November 2026 as time may not permit responses to questions received after that date to be prepared and issued prior to receipt of quotes. &nbsp;  

 Responses to this solicitation shall be submitted via email to Abbey Taylor at mary.a.taylor263.civ@us.navy.mil no later than 18 November 2026 at 10:00AM EST.&nbsp;
